# ECC and other plugin installers write vendored agent files into this dir
# through the ~/.claude*/agents symlink. They are machine-local and
# reproducible; only the whitelisted personas below are version-controlled.
# This committed whitelist outranks the machine-local .git/info/exclude
# pattern (claude/agents/*.md), so tracked personas stay addable.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitkeep
!/director.md
